#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:1
msgid "开场动态漫画脚本"
msgstr "Opening Animated Comic Script"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "作者"
msgstr "Author"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;BackSlzeep"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;BackSlzeep"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "主题编号"
msgstr "Theme No."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "主题"
msgstr "Theme"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "镜头号"
msgstr "Shot No."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "画面"
msgstr "Visual"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "声音"
msgstr "Audio"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "文字或标记"
msgstr "Text or Marker"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "回忆现实中病床上的少女的故事"
msgstr "Recalling the story of the girl on the hospital bed in reality"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "文字：病患因于脑机端口进行游戏时，数据流过载而导致脑部受损，昏迷一周期间第三次苏醒。目前情况稳定，允许通讯请求，注意通话时长，留心来自医疗检测仪的提示，遵循紧急状况的指示。"
msgstr ""
"Text: The patient suffered brain damage due to data stream overload while"
" gaming via the brain-computer interface port. This is the third "
"awakening during a one-week coma. Current condition is stable. "
"Communication requests are permitted. Please note the call duration, pay "
"attention to prompts from the medical monitoring device, and follow "
"emergency instructions."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "画面来自，医疗Ⅲ型；通讯对象：\\*\\*（女主名字）；"
msgstr "Image source: Medical Type III; Contact: \\*\\* (Heroine's name);"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "通话UI，画面：女主闭眼躺在医疗舱中，苍白。记录UI：自动记录中：（对话内容）"
msgstr ""
"Call UI. Visual: The heroine lies with closed eyes in a medical pod, "
"pale. Recording UI: Auto-recording: (dialogue content)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声1（隔呼吸器，虚弱的声音）：“你可能觉得只是个游戏，在我看来，就是另一个世界，和我们完全一样的另一个世界”"
msgstr ""
"Female Voice 1 (through breather, weak voice): \"You may think it's just "
"a game, but to me, it's another world — another world exactly like "
"ours.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "生命信号：弱；自主意识：弱；表达参考价值：低；建议：尽早结束案件咨询，确保病患情绪处于平和状态"
msgstr ""
"Vital signs: Weak; Autonomous consciousness: Weak; Expressive reference "
"value: Low; Recommendation: End the case consultation as soon as possible"
" to ensure the patient's emotional state remains calm."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "游戏世界的城市中发生着暴乱"
msgstr "Riots are occurring in the game world's city."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "全景，地下城主竖井底，满是霓虹灯光的街区里，发疯的游戏NPC在互相争斗，抢夺城市里的物资，发生着各式暴力的行为。"
msgstr ""
"Wide shot. Bottom of the underground city's main shaft. In neon-lit "
"streets, deranged game NPCs fight each other, grabbing city supplies. "
"Various acts of violence are occurring."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声1：“那里，本来是个美好的世界。”"
msgstr "Female Voice 1: \"That place... was originally a beautiful world.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "远景，城市里发生着火灾，多处是浓烟与火光。画面近处也发生了一场骚乱引发的爆炸。"
msgstr ""
"Long shot. Fires are breaking out across the city, with smoke and flames "
"in multiple locations. In the foreground, an explosion caused by a riot "
"also occurs."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声1：“要不是我这个异类的加入”爆炸声音，远处尖叫哭喊混杂着坍塌声音，"
msgstr ""
"Female Voice 1: \"If not for the intrusion of an outsider like me...\" "
"Explosion sounds. Distant screams and crying mixed with collapsing "
"sounds."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "妮妮莉特正在逃脱跟踪自己的神秘人"
msgstr "Ninillet is escaping from a mysterious person tracking her."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "（人物中景，长镜头，仰角）背景：地下城竖井高大的建筑、霓虹灯，着火的建筑，竖井口顶端的圆形。妮妮莉特（半透明的兜帽，皮外伤，神情紧张）背朝地下城市，面朝镜头紧步小跑，与镜头平行移动，背景的城市淡去，色彩灰暗。妮妮莉特左右张望，低头进入方形门，门合上。"
msgstr ""
"(Character medium shot, long take, low angle) Background: Tall buildings "
"of the underground city shaft, neon lights, burning buildings, the "
"circular opening at the top of the shaft. Ninillet (translucent hood, "
"minor abrasions, tense expression) walks briskly with her back to the "
"underground city, facing the camera, moving parallel to the camera. The "
"background city fades, colors turning gray. Ninillet looks left and "
"right, then ducks through a square door. The door closes."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声1：“你要在游戏里保护一个人，她的名字叫妮妮莉特，和我很像的一个女孩子。”音效：轻微喘息声音，门关上的声音"
msgstr ""
"Female Voice 1: \"You need to protect someone in the game. Her name is "
"Ninillet — a girl very much like me.\" Sound effects: Light panting, the "
"sound of a door closing."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "跟踪妮妮莉特的神秘人现身"
msgstr "The mysterious person tracking Ninillet reveals themselves."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "6"
msgstr "6"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "镜头稍往后移，在街边比较隐蔽的角落，一个戴着牛仔帽身材健硕的男人（乌云）的身影进入视野，一直在暗中观察妮妮莉特动向的他看到妮妮莉特逃离后，抬手压了下帽沿并准备离开。画面变黑淡出。"
msgstr ""
"The camera pulls back slightly. In a hidden corner by the street, the "
"figure of a muscular man wearing a cowboy hat (Wuyun) enters the frame. "
"Having been secretly observing Ninillet's movements, he sees her escape, "
"tips his hat brim down, and prepares to leave. The screen fades to black."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "妮妮莉特逃至安全屋"
msgstr "Ninillet escapes to the safe house."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "7"
msgstr "7"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "画面由黑渐入，（全景）军事学园基地的一个昏暗的场景，有屏闪的红色的警戒文字缓缓亮起，文字为“幽兰军事学园，危险禁入！”，闪光照亮了基地运载电梯的大门，妮妮莉特站在电梯口。电梯内战斗型辅助机处于待机中。"
msgstr ""
"The image gradually fades in from black. (Wide shot) A dimly lit scene at"
" the Military Academy base. Flashing red warning text slowly lights up: "
"\"Youlan Military Academy — Danger, Do Not Enter!\" The flash illuminates"
" the gate of the base's cargo elevator. Ninillet stands at the elevator "
"entrance. Inside the elevator, a combat-type support machine is on "
"standby."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "妮妮莉特开始准备应对新的危险"
msgstr "Ninillet begins preparing to face new danger."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "中景，妮妮莉特点击耳机，确认与辅助机的通信。"
msgstr ""
"Medium shot. Ninillet taps her earpiece, confirming communication with "
"the support machine."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声2：“打开装备舱。”"
msgstr "Female Voice 2: \"Open the equipment bay.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "9"
msgstr "9"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "近景，辅助机没有反应。"
msgstr "Close-up. The support machine doesn't respond."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "10"
msgstr "10"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "妮妮莉特狠狠踢了辅助机一脚，辅助机条件反射进入规避模式，四处观察。"
msgstr ""
"Ninillet gives the support machine a hard kick. The support machine "
"instinctively enters evasion mode, looking around."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声2：”打开装备舱！“"
msgstr "Female Voice 2: \"Open the equipment bay!\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "11"
msgstr "11"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "辅助机把头转向妮妮莉特，突然理解（迟钝），打开装备仓。"
msgstr ""
"The support machine turns its head toward Ninillet, suddenly "
"understanding (belatedly), and opens the equipment bay."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "12"
msgstr "12"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "枪械舱特写，一支枪被取走。"
msgstr "Close-up of the firearm bay. A gun is taken out."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "13"
msgstr "13"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "特写，上臂的外骨骼，镜头上移，外骨骼线路集成在身后伸向后颈，妮妮莉特挽起长发，露出后颈的脑机接口，插入，战斗预设芯片，外骨骼的蓝色灯光从后颈开始缓缓亮起。"
msgstr ""
"Close-up. The exoskeleton on the upper arm. The camera pans up. The "
"exoskeleton's wiring integrates behind the back, extending to the nape. "
"Ninillet gathers up her long hair, revealing the brain-computer interface"
" at her nape. She inserts the combat preset chip. The exoskeleton's blue "
"lights slowly illuminate starting from the nape."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "战斗装备的机械音效，枪械的电子充能音效"
msgstr ""
"Mechanical sound effects of combat equipment, electronic charging sound "
"of the firearm."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "14"
msgstr "14"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "中景，场景中突然传来一声巨响，妮妮莉特立即摆出战斗姿态，并朝向声音的来源看去。"
msgstr ""
"Medium shot. A loud crash suddenly echoes through the scene. Ninillet "
"immediately assumes a combat stance and looks toward the source of the "
"sound."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "金属撞击声音（进入学园基地的怪物正在破坏建筑）"
msgstr ""
"Metal crashing sounds (monsters entering the academy base are destroying "
"buildings)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "15"
msgstr "15"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "妮妮莉特眼神特写，惊慌害怕，深紫色的虹膜中，映着红色警戒灯的底色。蓝色武器装备的反光，在瞳孔上越来越亮。听到战斗装备充能完毕提示声后，她的眼神开始变得坚定。"
msgstr ""
"Close-up of Ninillet's eyes — panicked and fearful. In her deep purple "
"irises, the red warning lights are reflected. The blue reflection of "
"weaponry equipment grows brighter on her pupils. After hearing the combat"
" equipment charging complete prompt, her gaze becomes resolute."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "电子充能音效结束，预设加载完毕"
msgstr "Electronic charging sound effect ends. Preset loading complete."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "16"
msgstr "16"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "近景，妮妮莉特确认周围环境，再次按下耳麦正要说出电梯的口令。画面突然变全黑，然后听到一声“启动！”。"
msgstr ""
"Close-up. Ninillet confirms her surroundings and presses the earpiece "
"again, about to speak the elevator command. The screen suddenly goes "
"completely black, then a voice says: \"Activate!\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声2和另一个电子语音混合：“启动！”"
msgstr "Female Voice 2 mixed with another electronic voice: \"Activate!\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "主角开始登入游戏（开始衔接游戏场景的额外部分）"
msgstr ""
"The protagonist begins logging into the game (starting the extra segment "
"connecting to the game scene)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "17"
msgstr "17"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "（画面变成VR游戏的启动界面）全黑的屏幕正中突然闪现“启动”二个大字，背景逐渐淡入游戏加载特效并过渡成全白，然后画面再次淡入，以第一人称看到军事学园运输电梯的大门正在打开。"
msgstr ""
"(The screen becomes a VR game startup interface) In the center of the "
"completely black screen, the words \"ACTIVATE\" suddenly flash. The "
"background gradually fades in with game loading effects and transitions "
"to all white. Then the image fades in again: in first-person view, the "
"gates of the Military Academy transport elevator are opening."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "主角与妮妮莉特相遇"
msgstr "The protagonist meets Ninillet."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "18"
msgstr "18"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "电梯后出现一个武装的少女，立即警觉地用枪瞄准主角，并开始进行询问。然后画面淡出，并进入游戏场景。"
msgstr ""
"Behind the elevator, an armed young woman appears, immediately alert and "
"aiming her gun at the protagonist, beginning to interrogate. Then the "
"screen fades out and enters the game scene."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:3
msgid "女声2：“你是什么人？你为什么会出现在这里？”"
msgstr "Female Voice 2: \"Who are you? Why are you here?\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:29
#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/opening-pv.md:33
msgid "开场故事场景切换示意图"
msgstr "Opening Story Scene Transition Diagram"

